<!doctype html>
<html lang="en">
<head>
<meta charset="utf-8">
<meta name="viewport" content="width=device-width, initial-scale=1">
<title>AI spend memo</title>
</head>
<body>
<h1>AI spend memo for <time datetime="{{ month }}">{{ month }}</time></h1>
<p class="banner">This memo runs on a toy synthetic company. Its effects are planted by the generator: recovering them shows that the method works, not anything about a real company. The estimator behind it is a throwaway stub.</p>
<p>Company AI spend in <time datetime="{{ month }}">{{ month }}</time> was <a href="prov/{{ rec.prov_id }}.html"><span data-prov="{{ rec.prov_id }}">{{ rec.display_value }}</span></a>.</p>
<ul>
{% for name, status, reason in teams %}
<li>{{ name }}: {{ status }}{% if reason %} ({{ reason }}){% endif %}</li>
{% endfor %}
</ul>
</body>
</html>
